# Memories Returning, Flashback {7}{U}{U}: cast from the graveyard (CR 702.34a) it is exiled afterwards. Bot1 casts it first from hand with Black Lotus and Mox
# Sapphire over a five-card library (Lightning Bolt, Memnite, Ornithopter, Mox Jet, Mox Ruby: it takes the Bolt and Mox Jet, Bot2 buries Memnite and
# Ornithopter, and the last card, Mox Ruby, comes to the hand), then flashes it back with nine blue mana from three more Black Lotuses. Only two cards, Memnite
# and Ornithopter, are left in the library (CR 609.3): both are revealed, Bot1 takes the Ornithopter and Bot2 puts the only card left, Memnite, on the
# bottom - the library of one - and the rest of the instructions have no card to act on. Memories Returning is in exile, not the graveyard.

